# Reference-layer intermediates, written by refscan139.py and documented in README.md as *not*
# part of the committed set: `refs/raw.json` is the pre-curation arXiv/Crossref dump (1,809
# records, ~2.8 MB) and is reproducible only with network access; every entry the pool keeps is
# already in `refs/pool.json`.  `*.stage` is the atomic-write sibling an interrupted run may leave
# behind.
refs/raw.json
refs/*.stage
__pycache__/
